cuequivariance or cuequivariance_torch is not available. Cuequivariance acceleration will be disabled.
usage: mace_create_lammps_model [-h] [--head [HEAD]] [--dtype [DTYPE]]
                                [--format FORMAT]
                                model_path

positional arguments:
  model_path       Path to the model to be converted to LAMMPS

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --head [HEAD]    Head of the model to be converted to LAMMPS (default: None)
  --dtype [DTYPE]  Data type of the model to be converted to LAMMPS (default:
                   float64)
  --format FORMAT  Old libtorch format, or new mliap format (default:
                   libtorch)
